            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two clinical observations of nasolabial cyst of uni- and bilateral localizations are reported. The comprehensive characteristic of nasolabial cysts is presented with special reference to the principal diagnostic criteria for this pathology and the potential diagnostic errors.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
